# Git Flow

- `main` is release-only and must remain deployable.
- Base normal work on `develop`, the integration branch.
- Create `feature/*` and `fix/*` branches from `develop`; open their pull requests to `develop`.
- Release by pull request from `develop` to `main`, then tag the release on `main`.
- Create `hotfix/*` branches from `main`; merge each hotfix into both `main` and `develop`.
- Keep pull requests focused, reviewable, and free of unrelated changes.
- Agents must not commit, push, merge, tag, or publish unless the user explicitly requests it.
